@startuml
title Secuencia: Tag → Edge → LoRa → Backbone/RPi → Listener → Backend → BD

actor Trabajador as Op
participant "Tag Bluetooth\n(TAGP-XXXX)" as Tag
participant "Pórtico Edge\n(Fijo/Sensor/Bus)" as Edge
participant "Red LoRa / RF\n+ Red Mina" as LoRaNet
participant "Pórtico Backbone\nConcentrador" as Backbone
participant "Raspberry Pi\nNodo Comunicaciones" as Rpi
participant "Red IP\n(LAN / cable radiante)" as Net
participant "zenit-listener\n(TCP Server + GUI)" as Listener
participant "backend-api\n(REST/gRPC)" as Backend
database "BD ZENIT\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Asignación de Tag ==
Op -> Backend : Registrar tag_assignment\n(tag → persona/vehiculo/equipo)
Backend -> DB : INSERT tag_assignment
DB --> Backend
Backend --> Op

== Lectura en terreno ==
Tag -> Edge : Beacon Bluetooth\n(id_tag, RSSI)
Edge -> Edge : Filtra tags validos\nsegun configuracion local

Edge -> LoRaNet : Trama LoRa/RF\n(tag_code, rssi, tipo_edge,\n ts_local, otros)
LoRaNet -> Backbone : Entrega trama al concentrador

Backbone -> Rpi : Enlace local\n(serie / RS485 / SPI)
Rpi -> Net : Abre socket TCP\nhacia zenit-listener
Rpi -> Net : Envia linea\n<tag_code:BT:YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS:GW_BACKBONE_01:EDGE_BUS:rssi=-70>

== Ingesta en Listener ==
Net -> Listener : Recibe linea TCP
Listener -> Listener : parse_frame()\n→ msg_id, edge_id, ts_edge,\n tag_code, edge_kind, rssi, extra

Listener -> Backend : POST /ingest/access-event\n(JSON con la lectura)

Backend -> DB : SELECT tag.id\nFROM tag WHERE code = tag_code
DB --> Backend : tag_id

Backend -> DB : SELECT gateway.id\nFROM gateway WHERE code = edge_id\n(get_or_create_gateway)
DB --> Backend : gateway_id

Backend -> DB : INSERT access_event\n(msg_id, tag_id, gateway_id,\n ts_edge, ts_ingested, signal,\n zone, direction, extra)
DB --> Backend : OK
Backend --> Listener : {status: "ok"}

== Visualización ==
Op -> Backend : GET /dashboard/porticos
Backend -> DB : Consultas a vistas\n(contadores, interior, buses)
DB --> Backend
Backend --> Op : KPIs, conteos, ultimas lecturas

@enduml